<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 01-JAN					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 01-JAN					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical cyclone Phil is mainly a risk to shipping as it stays off shore to the north of West Australia during the next 24 hours. Top winds near the center of Phil have dropped to 40 mph and the system is dissipating as it tracks to the west. Phil will be fully dissipated by 24-36 hours.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS  </p>
